WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.123 --> 00:00:04.586
- Nice hat.

00:00:04.586 --> 00:00:06.241
- Oh, thanks man.

00:00:07.491 --> 00:00:09.550
- Makes you look really cool.

00:00:09.648 --> 00:00:10.768
- Thanks.

00:00:12.358 --> 00:00:15.013
- I bet you get compliments all the time.

00:00:16.307 --> 00:00:18.122
- Sure do.

00:00:19.268 --> 00:00:24.231
(lighthearted music)

00:00:28.942 --> 00:00:30.852
- Ooh, that's a great hat.

00:00:30.852 --> 00:00:32.558
- Oh, you think so?

00:00:32.558 --> 00:00:34.231
- Mm-hmm.

00:00:36.520 --> 00:00:39.676
It looks so good on you,
you should totally buy it.

00:00:40.035 --> 00:00:41.254
- I don't know.

00:00:41.254 --> 00:00:42.676
Every time I try something new

00:00:42.676 --> 00:00:45.216
my friends just make fun of me.

00:00:45.216 --> 00:00:48.166
Plus I don't think I'm a hat guy.

00:00:48.166 --> 00:00:49.425
- I totally disagree.

00:00:49.425 --> 00:00:51.059
I think you're a hat guy.

00:00:51.059 --> 00:00:53.292
And I think you look handsome.

00:00:53.595 --> 00:00:54.875
(cash register rings)

00:00:54.875 --> 00:00:57.658
And you are all set, Elijah.

00:00:58.758 --> 00:01:00.328
- Thanks.

00:01:02.664 --> 00:01:04.394
I'm a hat guy.

00:01:05.343 --> 00:01:10.327
(upbeat music)

00:01:26.005 --> 00:01:27.004
Hey.

00:01:27.712 --> 00:01:28.873
Hola.

00:01:29.886 --> 00:01:30.617
Hey.

00:01:30.617 --> 00:01:31.938
You talkin' to me?

00:01:31.938 --> 00:01:33.148
Hi, I'm Elliott.

00:01:33.148 --> 00:01:34.459
Hi, how are you?

00:01:34.459 --> 00:01:36.736
(grunting)

00:01:37.220 --> 00:01:38.564
Oh, hey.

00:01:41.060 --> 00:01:42.120
Yup.

00:01:45.222 --> 00:01:46.847
- Nice hat, douche.

00:01:46.847 --> 00:01:48.398
(clears throat)

00:01:51.622 --> 00:01:56.604
(upbeat music)

00:02:04.216 --> 00:02:05.583
- Hi.

00:02:05.638 --> 00:02:07.121
- Oh, hey guys.

00:02:07.121 --> 00:02:10.049
- Sarah, up here.

00:02:10.049 --> 00:02:11.002
- We made a series.

00:02:11.002 --> 00:02:12.485
- It's coming on November 18th.

00:02:12.485 --> 00:02:13.866
- Please watch it.

00:02:13.866 --> 00:02:14.740
- Get it here.

00:02:14.740 --> 00:02:16.792
- [All] There, here. Over there.

00:02:16.792 --> 00:02:18.675
- I think they got it, okay.

00:02:18.869 --> 00:02:19.943
- You can see it.

00:02:19.943 --> 00:02:23.009
It'll be released 2015, November.

00:02:23.009 --> 00:02:24.031
Okay.

